{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The SCP Desktop Pals Pack is finally here! This DLC grants you access to the SCP pal collection, along with the SCP UI theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The pack includes the following pals:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP-999 (Tickle Monster)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP-173 (Peanut)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP-131 (Eye Pods)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP-049 (Plague Doctor)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP-939 (The Dog)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This pack includes the following UI themes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCP UI Theme</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649040/extras/SCPShowcase.png?t=1744458875\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This work is based on content from the SCP Foundation (scpwiki) and is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0. Original authors retain their rights. This DLC content also falls under this license and I encourage community members to reuse and adapt them. To make this process easier, our discord provides a public folder link to all of this DLC content. Credit and my personal thank you to the SCP authors; ProfSnider,\u00a0Moto42,\u00a0Lt Masipag,\u00a0Gabriel Jade &amp;\u00a0djkaktus,\u00a0Adam Smascher &amp; EchoFourDelta. Art by\u00a0@keelysari4 and @osteo_blib.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649040?t=1744458875","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649040?t=1744458875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649040/36008508394cbf77ae29321a6a6cf88c7c350f91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744458875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/